- Pre-existing PHPCS warnings in `includes/Core/Settings.php` (35 warnings) and `includes/Core/AbilityVisibility.php` (1 warning) — separate quality-debt items; do not fix in this PR.
- The E2E shard-2 timeout in `changes-page.spec.js` is tracked separately.

