## Implementation details

### `isCurrentLocation(url)`

Compare `affected.url` with `window.location.href` after stripping query
strings and trailing slashes. Be permissive — both `/about` and
`/about/` and `/?p=42` referring to the same post must match. The agent
returns the result of `get_permalink()`, which uses pretty permalinks
when the site has them enabled.

```js
function normalize( u ) {
    try {
        const url = new URL( u, window.location.origin );
        url.search = '';
        url.hash = '';
        return url.pathname.replace( /\/+$/, '' );
    } catch {
        return '';
    }
}
function isCurrentLocation( url ) {
    return normalize( url ) === normalize( window.location.href );
}
```

### `fetchFreshPage(url)`

```js
async function fetchFreshPage( url ) {
    const bust = url + ( url.includes( '?' ) ? '&' : '?' ) + '_=' + Date.now();
    const res = await fetch( bust, {
        credentials: 'same-origin',
        cache: 'no-store',
        headers: { Accept: 'text/html' },
    } );
    if ( ! res.ok ) {
        throw new Error( `HTTP ${ res.status }` );
    }
    const html = await res.text();
    return new DOMParser().parseFromString( html, 'text/html' );
}
```

### `pickTargetsForFields(fields)`

Map `affected.fields` entries to CSS selectors. Use block-theme-friendly
selectors with classic-theme fallbacks:

| Field | Selectors (in priority order) |
|---|---|
| `post_title` | `.wp-block-post-title`, `.entry-title`, `h1.entry-title` |
| `post_content` | `.wp-block-post-content`, `.entry-content`, `article .entry-content` |
| `post_excerpt` | `.wp-block-post-excerpt`, `.entry-summary` |
| `featured_image` | `.wp-block-post-featured-image img`, `.post-thumbnail img` |

For each field, the first selector that exists in BOTH `document` and
the fresh DOM is the target. If none match, skip silently.

### `morphTargetFromFresh(currentDoc, freshDoc, selector)`

```js
import morphdom from 'morphdom';

function morphTargetFromFresh( currentDoc, freshDoc, selector ) {
    const current = currentDoc.querySelector( selector );
    const fresh = freshDoc.querySelector( selector );
    if ( ! current || ! fresh ) return;
    morphdom( current, fresh, {
        onBeforeElUpdated( fromEl, toEl ) {
            // Preserve focused inputs / contenteditable.
            if ( fromEl === document.activeElement ) return false;
            // Skip nodes inside the sd-ai-agent chat widget itself.
            if ( fromEl.closest && fromEl.closest( '#sdaa-floating-root' ) ) return false;
            return ! fromEl.isEqualNode( toEl );
        },
    } );
}
```

